{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">美國保守派評論員扎卡里亞，獲總統特朗普任命為白宮新聞秘書。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">42歲的扎卡里亞是特朗普媒體科技集團旗下「真實社交」網站的高級通訊顧問，她曾任國土安全部公共事務副助理部長，又在多個保守派媒體，包括霍士新聞擔任評論員。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">特朗普形容扎卡里亞表現出色，曾協助他在關鍵搖擺州競選中取勝。自8月底萊維特離職後，白宮發言人職位一直空缺。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.WHITEHOUSE-0700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026owXErzDgnA1791590782.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.US.WHITEHOUSE-0700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T00:38:55.039475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}